# Content-contract inventory consumed by `tools/ci/ci.sh validate`.
#
# Format: status|path|milestone|note
#   required  the path must exist or `validate` fails
#   pending   the path is planned and not produced yet: reported as a warning,
#             and enforced as a failure with `validate --strict-contracts`
#   optional  reported for information only
#
# This list is an inventory of what the plan requires, not a content
# validation. Validating course geometry, asset provenance or license notices
# (verification matrix rows T09/T15) is not implemented and is not claimed here.
# When those validators land, wire them into `ci.sh validate` and move the
# matching rows to `required`.
required|project.godot|M0.2|Engine configuration and the shell's entry point.
required|scenes/|M0.2|Boot, menu and race scenes.
required|src/|M0.2|Typed GDScript sources.
required|tools/car_recipe_schema/run_tests.sh|M0.2|Standard-library source-recipe checker suite; hosted CI runs it from the exact checkout.
required|tools/smoke/|M0.4|Existing headless smoke runner used by `ci.sh test`.
pending|tests/|M0.4|Original headless test runner, fixtures and integration scenarios.
pending|schemas/|M0.9|Versioned handling/AI/reference/scenario schemas.
pending|fixtures/|M0.9|Fixture configurations derived from docs/BENCHMARKS.md.
pending|licenses/|M0.3|CC0 asset notice and exact dependency notices.
pending|provenance/|M0.3|Authoring records and third-party evidence.
pending|content/|M1|Car, track and event source definitions.
pending|assets/|M2|Generated assets and assets/manifest.json.
pending|models/|M4B|Learned policy weights and model cards.
pending|training/|M4B|Environment bridge, datasets and training/evaluation tools.
optional|export_presets.cfg|M0.5|Native export presets; `ci.sh export --check` fails clearly until they exist.
